* Board 3, circuit 3: noise generator's filters (Fig. 9-8), as drawn, from the white noise
* follower Q4's emitter on. white: Q4's emitter; pink: Q3's collector (ahead of C20);
* red: R12 / C7 (ahead of the follower Q6). vp: the +10 V rail (probable: the drawing does
* not name the rail R3 hangs on).
.subckt noisefilters white pink red vp
r16 white p 10k
c3 p p3 0.12u
r8 p3 0 3.3k
c2 p p2 0.033u
r13 p2 0 220
c1 p b3 2.5u
q3 pink b3 e3 Q2N3392
r1 e3 0 120
r3 vp pink 3.3k
r6 pink m 560k
r7 m b3 560k
c4 m 0 2.5u
r12 pink red 10k
c7 red 0 0.15u
.ends
